row's foot = zero or many&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Dashed box/lines: Qdrant collection linked by payload fields (no DB-enforced FK).&lt;br&gt;audit_log is filled by triggers and refers to any table via table_name + row_id.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Colours: blue = player · green = NPCs · yellow = quests · orange = items &amp;amp; economy · red = combat · purple = audit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fillColor=#fafafa;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1600" y="200" width="300" height="290" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>